  "notes": "This is the state MyJewl ships in, on purpose. The repository supplies the SLOT for an alloy price; the operator supplies the number. Every entry here refuses itself, so every quote reports metal_content_cost: null with a reason naming which condition failed. To declare real prices: copy this file, fill it in, and point MYJEWL_ALLOY_PRICE_SHEET at the copy. Do not commit real spot prices into the repository -- they go stale silently, and a stale price looks live.",
